[32m+[m[32m# VerifyMacros.jl[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m> A Julia package for runtime verification with descriptive, styled error messages.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mRuntime verification often involves repetitive boilerplate and generic error messages. VerifyMacros.jl provides a suite of macros to assert conditions (types, keys, files, etc.) and produces auto-generated, color-coded, and descriptive errors when those assertions fail.[m
